# DIGEST STABILITY.
#
# R1_TRIAL_REGISTRY.md pins sha256 values of files in this repository, and the
# validator recomputes them. Git must therefore never rewrite line endings on
# add or on checkout: a CRLF/LF conversion would silently change every digest
# on a fresh clone and make the pins unverifiable.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion; `diff` keeps the files textual
# for diffing, so history stays readable.

* -text diff
